        "prompt": {
          "lines": [
            "<p>Now hit \"BEAT-LOOP\".  This will loop all the beats in this Section (tutorial step).  You'll see the \n            Fingering notes played one by one on the neck of our \"One-String Guitar\".  On your real guitar, you'll \n            follow along by playing the note at the fret on the fattest string of your guitar.  Use the finger indicated in the \n            circled note, and slide your hand up to a new position everywhere you see the (1) being played.\n        </p>"
