        "caption": "Scale in E Major",
        "prompt": {
          "lines": [
            "<p>Now on the E string, which is the fattest string on the 4-string bass or the guitar, \n        play the E Major scale.  This is the first, and lowest, major scale you can play on the guitar.  Major scales \n    sound bright and happy, like a march or a band song, and like a lot of church hymns.  Many children's \nsongs are also in major scales.</p>"
          ]
        }
